
1. Computer will not power on:
Measure the desktop power supply's DC output voltages to check for expected power, without opening the power supply itself.

2. Smartphone will not charge:
Check an unplugged charging cable for continuity to identify broken wires or intermittent connections.

3. Smartphone shuts down unexpectedly:
Measure the battery's DC voltage to check for unusually low voltage, taking care not to short its terminals.
